  "_comment": "Copy to datasets.json (gitignored) and edit the paths for this machine. A relative path is relative to this file. 'cache' is the folder build_cache writes (samples/, index.csv, vocab.json); 'protocols' are the --protocol values that read it by default; --cache <name> picks a dataset by name, GT_CACHE (a folder) beats both. 'sources' are the raw inputs a cache is built from, and where runs go; each has an environment variable that wins (GT_BUNDLE, GT_COLLECTIONS, GT_FOLDS, GT_FOLDS_V3, GT_READER_ROOT, GT_TOKEN_MAPPING_DIR, GT_RUNS). 'token_mapping' is the folder holding token_mapping.py, the module the caches' behaviour ids come from; it is not part of this package.",

